.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "2026-09-25" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR mystrcat ()
function appends the
.I src
string to the
.I dest
string overwriting the terminating null byte.
.SH AUTHOR
Ahmad Pervaiz <bsdsf24m013@pucit.edu.com>